(7705761, 1265457, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfect title! The second girl in looks as though she would rather be anywhere else!  The backdrop works well for your subject, but the lighting doesn''t work for you, and the image does have the feel of a quickly grabbed snap shot.</td>', 'Perfect title! The second girl in looks as though she would rather be anywhere else!  The backdrop works well for your subject, but the lighting doesn''t work for you, and the image does have the feel of a quickly grabbed snap shot.', '2021-11-05 05:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705762, 1265339, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh nice!  The positioning of the acorn in the beak could ot be more perfect even if it was stage-managed.  My only (tiny) criticism is the bright patch in the background above the beak.  I do think that the image could cope with a bit more sharpening for display at this size, the slight softness certainly isn''t a focus issue.  I also wonder whether a run through Topaz deNoise would help.  All that said, I really like this. 7</td>', 'Oh nice!  The positioning of the acorn in the beak could ot be more perfect even if it was stage-managed.  My only (tiny) criticism is the bright patch in the background above the beak.  I do think that the image could cope with a bit more sharpening for display at this size, the slight softness certainly isn''t a focus issue.  I also wonder whether a run through Topaz deNoise would help.  All that said, I really like this. 7', '2021-11-05 05:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705764, 1265373, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a delightful study!  There is a delicacy to this that I really enjoy. 8</td>', 'Oh, what a delightful study!  There is a delicacy to this that I really enjoy. 8', '2021-11-05 05:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705765, 1265461, 67258, '<td valign="top">A really good find, and intriguing cameo.  I can see that you have composed to level the horizontals, but my brain is now complaining that the verticals are off - you really can''t win!</td>', 'A really good find, and intriguing cameo.  I can see that you have composed to level the horizontals, but my brain is now complaining that the verticals are off - you really can''t win!', '2021-11-05 05:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705766, 1265233, 67258, '<td valign="top">Composing with the single flower broadly on the third was a good move, and the title is inspired.  Despite that, though, there just isn''t enough to hold my interest beyond an initial glance.  

<br/>I''ve just glanced up the page while writing this comment, and see the photo afresh, cropped from the top, and I personally prefer that - when presented with the square image the eye is drawn to the brighter foliage at the top of the photo which gives a bit of tension.</td>', 'Composing with the single flower broadly on the third was a good move, and the title is inspired.  Despite that, though, there just isn''t enough to hold my interest beyond an initial glance.  

I''ve just glanced up the page while writing this comment, and see the photo afresh, cropped from the top, and I personally prefer that - when presented with the square image the eye is drawn to the brighter foliage at the top of the photo which gives a bit of tension.', '2021-11-05 05:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7705770, 1265399, 67258, '<td valign="top">Are those berries really that colour?  I''ve never seen anything like them - and have to own, I find my brain fighting with the colour.  A cute capture, sharp in all the places it needs to be, and good exposure across the full tonal range.</td>', 'Are those berries really that colour?  I''ve never seen anything like them - and have to own, I find my brain fighting with the colour.  A cute capture, sharp in all the places it needs to be, and good exposure across the full tonal range.', '2021-11-05 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
