(7705955, 1265426, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, and wow some more! The detail is just incredible. I mean, look at the barbs on the seeds. Not a plain old dandelion, I don''t think, but you''ve captured details I''ve never noticed before on any seedhead. Which is very cool.</td>', 'Wow, wow, and wow some more! The detail is just incredible. I mean, look at the barbs on the seeds. Not a plain old dandelion, I don''t think, but you''ve captured details I''ve never noticed before on any seedhead. Which is very cool.', '2021-11-07 10:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
